7/5qfl_0df444a7-dc2d-49bd-81cd-2bdbee60793a.jpg?_a=BACMTiGT","position":1,"rental_id":267537,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:23.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:23.000000Z"},"reviews":[{"id":6124787,"review":"Lovely Apartment, highly Recommended!\n\nThis apartment is a gem! Bright and spacious.\n\nWould definitely stay here again, great value for the price!","rental_id":267537,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z"},{"id":6145465,"review":"Positive:\nVery dirty place, not maintained, many hazardous conditions and poor responses from property management\n\nNegative:\nI am disappointed at the  XURU Stays Egypt and Ocean Blue Security Management for their equally bad management in dealing with guests.\n\nI am staying at Ocean Blue apartment. I am extremely disappointed with the condition of the property. We arrived to find it dirty, poorly maintained, and containing several safety hazards for my family. I reported these issues to management immediately, but no action was taken, leaving us to spend the night in an unclean and unsafe apartment.\n\nAlthough management promised the apartment would be cleaned, they never provided a timeframe, and despite multiple follow-ups, we received no meaningful updates. Our requested baby crib was also not provided, and there were not enough towels for our family.\n\nThe check-in process was equally frustrating. We were left waiting for an extended period and then had to carry our luggage while managing our children up several flights of stairs.\n\nOverall, this has been a very disappointing experience, and I expected a much higher standard of cleanliness, safety, and customer service.\nThe seccond day the baby crib arrived and after multiple phone calls and numerous requests, the management finally sent their cleaning staff twice. The attached photos show the result of their \"cleaning,\" and I am honestly shocked.\n\nThe first time the cleaner came they only swept part of the apartment before leaving. I called management again, and when the cleaner returned, they argued with me, insisting the apartment would be cleaned the next day. I made it clear that this was unacceptable and demanded that it be cleaned immediately.\n\nI then had to personally supervise the entire cleaning process, repeatedly directing the staff to sweep and mop every room and area of the apartment. They only swept because they did not have a vacuum cleaner, and then they used our dirty towels to mop the floors. The attached photos clearly show both their cleaning methods and the amount of dirt and filth throughout the apartment.","rental_id":267537,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z"},{"id":6166520,"review":"Stedet var rent og pent akkurat som bilder, men hadde problem med å sjekke inn fra verten sin side ellers var alt bra.","rental_id":267537,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}